                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lo rrindiki, entoning te pooki bae lelo oora ilkituaak linyi te nkop, neme te nkisiaayiare oo nkonyek anaa looitiship iltung'ana, kake to ltau obo, iurere Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.22"
            ]
